ndard measures for typical impacts"}, {"title": "Institutional Arrangements", "hint": "Roles of implementing agencies"}, {"title": "Capacity Building", "hint": "Training needs and plan"}, {"title": "Consultation and Disclosure", "hint": "Engagement during preparation and implementation"}, {"title": "Grievance Redress Mechanism", "hint": "Procedure and timelines"}, {"title": "Monitoring and Reporting", "hint": "Indicators and reporting cycle"}, {"title": "Budget", "hint": "Cost of implementing the framework"}]}, {"id": "sep", "abbr": "SEP", "name": "Stakeholder Engagement Plan", "cat": "Safeguards reports", "theme": "indigo", "cover": "column", "font": "modern", "style": {"chapter": "band", "table": "minimal", "stat": "solid", "callout": "tint"}, "docType": "Stakeholder Engagement Plan", "desc": "Stakeholder mapping, engagement programme, disclosure and grievance arrangements under ESS10.", "sections": [{"title": "Introduction", "hint": "Purpose of the plan and project context"}, {"title": "Project Description", "hint": "Brief overview"}, {"title": "Summary of Previous Engagement", "hint": "Consultations held to date and key issues raised"}, {"title": "Stakeholder Identification and Analysis", "hint": "Affected parties, other interested parties, vulnerable groups"}, {"title": "Engagement Programme", "hint": "Methods, timing and topics by project phase and stakeholder group"}, {"title": "Information Disclosure", "hint": "What will be disclosed, where and how"}, {"title": "Resources and Responsibilities", "hint": "Staff, budget and roles"}, {"title": "Grievance Mechanism", "hint": "How grievances are received, resolved and recorded"}, {"title": "Monitoring and Reporting", "hint": "How engagement is tracked and reported back"}]}, {"id": "monitor", "abbr": "E&S", "name": "E&S Monitoring Report", "cat": "Monitoring & audit", "theme": "mangrove", "cover": "frame", "font": "institutional", "style": {"chapter": "number", "table": "solid", "stat": "tint", "callout": "tint"}, 